#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:5
msgid "Edit text field"
msgstr "编辑文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:8
msgid "Edit text field from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏编辑文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:10
#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:32
#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:49
msgid "Select the `text field`_ which should be edited."
msgstr "选择应当编辑的 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:11
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit the selected object** menu item to display the `text "
"editor PopUP window`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Edit > 编辑选中的对象** 菜单项以显示 `文本编辑器 PopUP 窗口 <text editor PopUP window_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:16
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:19
msgid "Edit text field by right click"
msgstr "右键编辑文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:21
msgid "Right click on the `text field`_ which should be edited."
msgstr "右键点击应当编辑的 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:22
msgid ""
"Select the option **Edit the text field** to display the `text editor PopUP "
"window`_."
msgstr "选择选项 **编辑文本字段** 以显示 `文本编辑器 PopUP 窗口 <text editor PopUP window_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:27
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech text field options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本字段选项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:30
msgid "Edit text field from selection properties panel"
msgstr "从选择属性面板编辑文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:33
msgid ""
"Click on **Advanced Editor** button from `selection properties panel`_ to "
"display the `text editor PopUP window`_."
msgstr ""
"点击 **高级编辑器** 按钮从 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 显示 `文本编辑器 PopUP 窗口 "
"<text editor PopUP window_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:38
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech text field selection properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本字段选择属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:42
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**"
msgstr ""
"如果不显示 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:45
msgid "Edit text field using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键编辑文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:47
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:50
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + e`` to display the `text editor PopUP window`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + e`` 显示 `文本编辑器 PopUP 窗口 <text editor PopUP window_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_edit.rst:54
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
